<title>UK: Unichem gets 0.4 pct of Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Unichem gets 0.4 pct of Lloyds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unichem Plc said on Monday its offer for LLoyds Chemists had been accepted by shareholders controlling 459,894 shares or about 0.4 percent of the equity by the first closing date on Saturday.</p>
<p>The company noted in a statement that it already held 9.9 percent of Lloyds and said it has now extended its offer to 1500 GMT on January 3.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
